<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of July 4.</p>
<p>				  July 04/July 03  July 04/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.08		 7.51</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.04		 5.99</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.22		11.68</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    0.85		49.34</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.47		37.35</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.49		38.03</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.15		14.51</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.02		31.70</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.55		45.90</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.54		44.78</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.45		25.87</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.92		91.75</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,548,803,249,105</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  1,987,543,509,426</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  3,227,070,161,487</p>
<p>  International funds			    98,950,684,654</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    235,238,893,537</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
